{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8813167, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "199844444189511417", "parent_topic": "ring", "speaker_id": "sotha_abstemiousfightr", "text": "We thank you once more.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8813370, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "16063235081962329956", "parent_topic": "ring", "speaker_id": "sotha_abstemiousfightr", "text": "Yes, we have heard. Perhaps this ring will return. Perhaps it will not. But we have word that for now, the ring is no longer real. You have our thanks, and our wealth.", "result_script": "Journal Sotha_fightring 50\r\nPlayer-> Additem \"Gold_001\" 1000", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8813804, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "2974528476940817377", "parent_topic": "ring", "speaker_id": "sotha_fightringleader", "text": "It was a matter of time before the Abstemious found out. Conflicts are something I wish to avoid. Entertainment, after all, is my business. At the very least they had the wisdom to send someone I trust. Very well, %PCName. Tell the Abstemious that I shall shut down my ring, in exchange for their help in establishing another diversion from life's horrors.", "result_script": "Journal sotha_fightring 45", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8814379, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "16418136071098111545", "parent_topic": "ring", "speaker_id": "sotha_fightringleader", "text": "Under whose authority? Yours? You are a stranger, with no power. Here, the power is in my hands. I run this ring singlehandedly, and you don't get to give me orders. Now please, get out of my sight.", "result_script": "ModDisposition -30", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8814787, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "2858132752211715586", "parent_topic": "ring", "speaker_id": "sotha_fightringleader", "text": "Yes, it is a nice little diversion for the downtrodden, a way to... unwind, after a hard day. Some oppose the... abuse, as they claim, on the fighters, but we must all suffer for entertainment, no?", "result_script": "Choice \"Shut this ring down.\" 1", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8815221, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "145364692238517115", "parent_topic": "ring", "cell_filter": "Sotha Sil, Secret Fight Club", "text": "Talk to Big Irethor-567, he runs things around here.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8815438, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "31155207393113420023", "parent_topic": "ring", "speaker_id": "sotha_fightringfarmer", "text": "Oh fine, I've been loaning them out to this 'underground fighting ring'. They meet every night, but I can't tell you where. The closest I can do is escort you.", "result_script": "Journal Sotha_fightring 20\r\nAddTopic \"escort you\"", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8815851, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "803025162819226571", "parent_topic": "ring", "speaker_id": "sotha_fightringfarmer", "text": "I have no idea what you're talking about. My fabricants are just getting restless lately, that's all.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8816149, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "532518039990613981", "parent_topic": "ring", "class_filter": "Farmer", "cell_filter": "Sotha Sil, Clockwork City, The Arboretum", "text": "Old Terreran's verm'cants have been looking worse for gear lately, you might want to talk to him.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8816477, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "20035147441725913249", "parent_topic": "ring", "speaker_id": "sotha_abstemiousfightr", "text": "Go to the arboretum, find this one who knows of the underground fighting ring. Find this underground fighting ring, and put a stop to it. Perhaps start by asking those in the arboretum?", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8816861, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "2814622381154412513", "parent_topic": "ring", "speaker_id": "sotha_abstemiousfightr", "text": "Livestock, built to live, forced to fight. As lovers of life, we hate that which harms it. One in the arboretum, we hear, helps run this underground ring. Find him, find the ring, stop it. Try not, in any way, to be violent. All life, even that which harms other life, is precious.", "result_script": "Journal Sotha_fightring 10", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "DIAL", "source_offset": 8817337, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "topic": "busy", "dialogue_type": "00"}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8817375, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "770718764608710795", "parent_topic": "busy", "speaker_id": "sotha_foremer", "text": "I am always busy.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8817555, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "233622226761216950", "parent_topic": "busy", "speaker_id": "sotha_foremer", "text": "The demands placed on the Chief Foremer are great, and I cannot delegate many tasks.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8817788, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "16157265272999626462", "parent_topic": "busy", "speaker_id": "Marena Gilnith", "text": "There's so much to do.  I don't mean to complain, but I never have enough free time.  And all I really wanted to do when I came to Mournhold was to meet someone new...", "result_script": "Journal MS_MatchMaker 10", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "DIAL", "source_offset": 8818175, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "topic": "tree", "dialogue_type": "00"}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8818213, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "1533215998718418833", "parent_topic": "tree", "speaker_id": "sotha_tree2", "text": "I am the Tree.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8818388, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "27136994426199201", "parent_topic": "tree", "speaker_id": "sotha_tree2", "text": "The Gardener has told you that the Arboretum is a lifeform, correct? Think of me as the mind of that lifeform. The Gardener is but an extension of myself, and while he directs the harvest, I direct the growth. I am the will of the plant made real, and I know how to end the infection, though I cannot act to do so.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "DIAL", "source_offset": 8818897, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "topic": "trio", "dialogue_type": "00"}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8818935, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "141822856584822843", "parent_topic": "trio", "speaker_id": "sotha_powerman", "text": "So, a rogue overclocker group seeks to use the power core to their own goals? This is worrisome, but I believe I know how to reach them. You spoke of a passage opened recently, no doubt found in the attack. I know such a house in which such things may have happened, but the Watchmen sealed it, and even now guard it.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8819416, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "259386222283403577", "parent_topic": "trio", "speaker_id": "sotha_clockersecret", "text": "Three of our number claimed recently that they uncovered a passage that lead straight to the grand powerworks. They had been making regular trips, bringing back their research to us, but a few weeks ago they merely disappeared under the claims of being able to ascend to a \"higher power\". To be honest, I'm not sure they completely know that it is the power core they've discovered. They seemed to be under the impression it was something else entirely!", "result_script": "Journal SSE_power 70", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "DIAL", "source_offset": 8820066, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "topic": "wine", "dialogue_type": "00"}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8820104, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "16270259462375811045", "parent_topic": "wine", "speaker_id": "sotha_drunkard", "text": "Aye, a fine wine is like a woman, it uses advanced ah to hell with that, not worth a joke.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "DIAL", "source_offset": 8820308, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "topic": "limb", "dialogue_type": "00"}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8820346, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "1640439991222714109", "parent_topic": "limb", "speaker_id": "sotha_slut", "text": "Oh no, not that unsanitary penetration stuff, that's disgusting! I am talking about pure love, swapping arms, running around with each other's legs, the good stuff.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "DIAL", "source_offset": 8820619, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "topic": "neck", "dialogue_type": "00"}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8820657, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "15698223502249115352", "parent_topic": "neck", "speaker_id": "sotha_headless", "text": "Again, thank you friend!", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8820852, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "338623188264515501", "parent_topic": "neck", "speaker_id": "sotha_headless", "text": "Oh my, I feels good to actually feel my legs. And arms. And anything really. That... skullspider, was it? Yes, that skullspider seemed to want to use my head as its new host! Quite horrible. But I'm a fabricant of my word. Have some gold, and this thing. It's the least I could do!", "result_script": "Journal Sotha_headless 30\r\nRemoveItem \"_headless\" 1\r\nPlayer-> RemoveItem \"sotha_fabhead\" 1\r\nPlayer-> Additem \"Gold_001\" 500\r\nPlayer-> Additem \"sotha_quartz_gaunt_r\" 1", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8821522, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "1431481162489526239", "parent_topic": "neck", "speaker_id": "sotha_headless", "text": "(The man fumbles for his head, takes it, and pops it on his neck. There is a strange suction sound.)", "result_script": "Choice \"Continue\" 1", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8821875, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "280408450540511128", "parent_topic": "neck", "speaker_id": "sotha_headless", "text": "(The man points to his neck, and makes motions with his hands.)", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8822126, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "170411368031765953", "parent_topic": "neck", "speaker_id": "sotha_headless", "text": "(The man fumbles for the paper, takes it, then fumbles in his pants. He pulls out a quill, and begins writing on the paper. Eventually, he hands it back to you, and gives you a thumbs up.)", "result_script": "Player-> RemoveItem \"sc_paper plain\" 1\r\nPlayer-> Additem \"sotha_headlessnote\" 1\r\nJournal Sotha_headless 20", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8822698, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "2013899993001123921", "parent_topic": "neck", "speaker_id": "sotha_headless", "text": "(The headless man pauses, holds out its hands, and begins making writing motions. It stops, and starts holding out the imaginary paper it was writing on.)", "result_script": "Journal Sotha_headless 10", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "DIAL", "source_offset": 8823016, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "topic": "Miri", "dialogue_type": "00"}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8823054, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "4026722177114691", "parent_topic": "Miri", "speaker_id": "sotha_miri", "text": "That's me, yes! Please, you're an adventurer, you're strong! Help me! I don't want to end up chopped up!", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8823321, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "2559414171176627513", "parent_topic": "Miri", "class_filter": "Acrobat", "cell_filter": "Sotha Sil, Residential District, Aroban's Sehtly Wonders", "text": "Girl over on table six, the redhead. She's the newest, and the youngest, so of course, she flips a gasket or two.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "DIAL", "source_offset": 8823659, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "topic": "maze", "dialogue_type": "00"}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8823697, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "256962623782427464", "parent_topic": "maze", "speaker_id": "sotha_mazewizard2", "text": "It's simple. If you escape, you escape! If you don't and die, you don't and die! You are my lab rat and I am your lab ratter! Now fear me and begin your challenge!", "result_script": "Journal Sotha_maze 10", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "DIAL", "source_offset": 8824004, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "topic": "soul", "dialogue_type": "00"}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8824042, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "992016618968816929", "parent_topic": "soul", "speaker_id": "sotha_judge", "text": "IF. I. WISHED. I. COULD. SHUT. DOWN. ALL. WATCHMEN. BUT. I. WILL. AND. CANNOT. MAKE. SUCH. A. CHOICE.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "DIAL", "source_offset": 8824252, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "topic": "hear", "dialogue_type": "00"}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8824290, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "995620026269404609", "parent_topic": "hear", "speaker_id": "sotha_judge", "text": "...\r\n...\r\n(There is the sound of someone taking a very deep breath.)\r\nIF YOU SHUT THE WATCHMEN DOWN, THERE IS NO ORDER IN THE CITY. CRIME WILL RUN RAMPANT, AND ALL SHALL FALL. THE BLOOD OF MANY WOULD BE ON YOUR HANDS. PERHAPS YOU WOULD LEARN FROM THIS. PERHAPS YOU WOULD NOT. IT IS NOT IN MY NATURE TO CARE. I ONLY SEEK TO TEACH. WHAT YOU DO WITH THAT KNOWLEDGE IS UP TO YOU.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "DIAL", "source_offset": 8824774, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "topic": "Hub", "dialogue_type": "00"}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8824811, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "1419547771844613781", "parent_topic": "Hub", "speaker_id": "sotha_foremer", "text": "The city restored. You have done work far greater than you imagine.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8825179, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "17273873232529876", "parent_topic": "Hub", "speaker_id": "sotha_foremer", "text": "The fearful.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8825340, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "11627267171876228698", "parent_topic": "Hub", "cell_filter": "Sotha Sil,", "text": "The Hub District ties the whole city together, as it's the only district that has access to the rest of the city. It also serves as the entry and exit point of the city, so you might call it the beating heart of the city. Or, at least, the beating heart-like metallic device of the city. It houses Fyr Manor, the Clocktower, and the Watchman's Headquarters, along with some residences and shops.", "quest_flags": {}}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "DIAL", "source_offset": 8825901, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "topic": "fee", "dialogue_type": "00"}
{"source_file": "Sotha Sil Expanded.ESP", "source_sha256": "d8af26f23fe5d1c0fe7119e82762e4515de2eee6a9c6ffadd697d1524ed24b85", "record_type": "INFO", "source_offset": 8825938, "record_flags": "0x00000000", "info_id": "280606121119218269", "parent_topic": "fee", "speaker_id": "sotha_aughead", "text": "Very well. If you still wish to talk surgery, my door is always open.\r\nNot that I have a door, but you understand.", "quest_flags": {}}
